Announcing The Battle Cats HALLOWEEN COSTUME BALL!<br>
☆☆☆ NOW ACCEPTING ENTRIES UNTIL OCT. 24th! ☆☆☆

The spookiest season is now upon us as All Hallows Eve fast approaches! What better way to celebrate than by showing us your fantastic ideas for a brand new look for your favorite Battle Cat?

We're charging all Battle Cats fans with a talent for fanart to draw, paint, or design an original Cat design and post it as an image with the hashtag #BattleCatsHalloween!

We'll be taking entries by Facebook, Twitter, and Instagram until Oct. 24th, then our design team will choose their favorites for the fan to vote on as the best of the bunch! Three lucky winners will get a Battle Cats plushie (and of course, there'll be something special for everyone for participating...)

What are you waiting for? All you have to do is:<br>
① Draw a cool Cat design!<br>
② Post it with the hashtag #BattleCatsHalloween (make sure it's a Public post)!<br>
③ Check back on 10/24 to see if your Cat made it to the next round!

Now lets get the party started! (=ↀωↀ=)～✧

