☆☆BATTLE CATS HALLOWEEN BALL FINAL ROUND☆☆<br>
☆☆ October 25th through 31st ☆☆<br>
We've finally reached the playoff round of our Halloween extravaganza! Did you get your Rare Ticket of thanks from us??<br>
We had hundreds of amazing entries on Facebook, Twitter and Instagram, and we are happy to present the 11 artists who were chosen by the PONOS designer team themselves for a chance to win our grand prize: a Battle Cats plushie of their very own!<br>
Check out the gallery of finalists attached to this post and LIKE your favorites! At 11:59pm on October 31st, we'll count up the Like total for each design and give the top 3 their grand prize reward!<br>
(If you really want to boost a design, you can even SHARE it to your friends!)<br>
The voting starts now! Good luck to all our artists!<br>
